{"ticker":"AOS","updated":"2026-10-30T22:34:26Z","profile":{"longName":"A. O. Smith Corporation","shortName":"A.O. Smith Corporation","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","country":"United States","website":"https://www.aosmith.com","fullTimeEmployees":11500,"marketCap":8472127488,"trailingPE":17.568245,"forwardPE":16.167028,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.227807,"pegRatio":1.52,"targetMeanPrice":66.2,"targetHighPrice":80.0,"targetLowPrice":55.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":10,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":-0.002,"earningsGrowth":-0.013,"grossMargins":0.38618,"operatingMargins":0.18628,"profitMargins":0.13006,"totalRevenue":3802899968,"beta":1.11,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":81.87,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":54.16,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.39},"summary":"A. O. Smith Corporation manufactures and markets residential and commercial gas and electric water heaters, boilers, heat pumps, tanks, and water treatment products in North America, China, Europe, and India. The company offers water heaters for residences, restaurants, hotels, office buildings, laundries, car washes, and small businesses; boilers for hospitals, schools, hotels, homes, apartments, and condominiums, and other large commercial buildings; and water treatment products comprising point-of-entry water softeners, well water solutions, and whole-home water filtration products, and point-of-use carbon and reverse osmosis products for residences, restaurants, hotels, and offices. It also provides commercial water treatment and filtration products; expansion tanks, commercial solar water heating systems, swimming pool and spa heaters, and related products and parts; and electric wall-hung, gas tankless, combi-boiler, and heat pump and solar water heaters. The company offers its products under the A. O. Smith, State, Lochinvar, Hague, Water-Right, Master Water, Atlantic Filter, Impact, and Water Tec brands. It distributes its products through independent wholesale plumbing distributors, as well as to retail channels consisting of hardware and home center chains, and manufacturer representative firms, as well as offers Aquasana branded products directly to consumers through","summary_zh":"A. O. Smith Corporation 在北美、中國、歐洲和印度生產和銷售住宅和商用燃氣和電熱水器、鍋爐、熱泵、水箱和水處理產品。該公司為住宅、餐廳、酒店、辦公大樓、洗衣店、洗車店和小型企業提供熱水器；醫院、學校、酒店、家庭、公寓和公寓以及其他大型商業建築的鍋爐；水處理產品，包括入口點軟水器、井水解決方案和全家庭水過濾產品，以及用於住宅、餐廳、酒店和辦公室的使用點碳和反滲透產品。它還提供商業水處理和過濾產品；膨脹水箱、商用太陽能熱水系統、游泳池和水療加熱器以及相關產品和零件；以及電動壁掛式、無水箱燃氣式、組合式鍋爐、熱泵和太陽能熱水器。該公司以 A. O. Smith、State、Lochinvar、Hague、Water-Right、Master Water、Atlantic Filter、Impact 和 Water Tec 品牌提供產品。該公司透過獨立的管道批發分銷商以及由硬體和家居中心連鎖店以及製造商代表公司組成的零售通路分銷其產品，並透過以下方式直接向消費者提供 Aquasana 品牌產品：","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"特種工業機械","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":70.67,"h":70.96,"l":70.08,"c":70.38,"v":1311500},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":70.0,"h":71.16,"l":70.0,"c":70.79,"v":1337100},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":71.22,"h":72.64,"l":70.79,"c":72.64,"v":1185900},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":73.04,"h":74.09,"l":72.94,"c":73.68,"v":1445100},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":73.41,"h":74.09,"l":72.67,"c":73.96,"v":1165600},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":73.48,"h":73.56,"l":71.26,"c":72.0,"v":1200300},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":71.73,"h":72.65,"l":71.69,"c":72.49,"v":1105000},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":72.73,"h":74.72,"l":72.5,"c":74.3,"v":1673100},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":73.81,"h":74.16,"l":72.53,"c":72.57,"v":766700},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":72.83,"h":73.43,"l":72.47,"c":73.25,"v":799600},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":73.3,"h":73.71,"l":72.78,"c":73.61,"v":640100},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":73.98,"h":75.2,"l":72.65,"c":73.12,"v":1083200},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":73.26,"h":73.52,"l":72.69,"c":73.07,"v":915800},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":72.88,"h":73.39,"l":72.47,"c":73.09,"v":2025700},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":72.78,"h":72.82,"l":72.09,"c":72.26,"v":769400},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":72.49,"h":73.33,"l":71.74,"c":72.17,"v":622300},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":71.83,"h":72.7,"l":71.73,"c":71.96,"v":820900},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":71.97,"h":72.15,"l":71.